# Tabular File Understanding Rule

When working with large tabular files, follow the skill instructions in:

```text
skills/tabular-file-understanding/SKILL.md
```

Use Python only. Do not paste large tables into chat context. Generate compact profiling artifacts with:

```bash
python skills/tabular-file-understanding/scripts/profile_tabular_file.py --input <file> --out <output_dir>
```

Read `table_digest.md` and `ambiguities.md` before doing downstream analysis.

For sensitive files, add `--redact-samples` or `--no-samples`.
